Jump to a repository and open it in your editor (needs shell integration)

Usage: work on [OPTIONS] <QUERY>

Arguments:
  <QUERY>  Repository query: name, org/name, or domain/org/name

Options:
      --pick  Always show the picker when several repositories match
  -h, --help  Print help
